  "name": "pyspades",
  "description": "A Python-based implementation of the Ace of Spades network protocol, providing a high-performance server environment for voxel-based tactical shooters. It integrates the ENet reliable UDP library and implements custom voxel (VXL) map handling, collision detection, and a modular script-based game logic system. The architecture leverages Cython bindings for performance-critical networking while utilizing a flexible plugin system for extensible gameplay mechanics.",
